# Stack

- Nuxt 3 (Composition API + `<script setup>` for new/edited files).
- Contentful CDA via `plugins/contentful.ts` (`$contentful`). Prefer `useAsyncData` on pages.
- Tailwind + existing SCSS in `assets/css`. Extend tokens, don't invent a second system.
- Hosting: Vercel. Secrets only in `runtimeConfig` / Vercel env — never hardcode SMTP or tokens.
- Domain: `aokemz.ru`. Company: ОАО «Карпинский электромашиностроительный завод» (Карпинск), not Кемерово.
- Brand facts and inventable content: `docs/brand-facts.md`.
- Design language: hybrid industrial — read `.cursor/skills/kemz-industrial-design/SKILL.md` before UI work.
- Copy / headlines / SEO text: read `.cursor/skills/stop-slop/SKILL.md` — no AI marketing slop.
- Graphify: if `graphify-out/graph.json` exists, prefer `graphify query` / `path` / `explain` for codebase questions.
